 "hast": "\n<p>Introducing Luma, a new shadcn/ui style. Rounded geometry. Soft elevation. Breathable layouts. Inspired by macOS Tahoe, minus the glass.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"a\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;href&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/create&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"Image\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;src&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/images/luma-light.png&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;width&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;2160&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;height&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;1832&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;alt&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;Luma style preview&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border dark:hidden&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"Image\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;src&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/images/luma-dark.png&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;width&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;2160&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;height&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;1832&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;alt&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;Luma style preview&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 hidden w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border shadow-sm dark:block&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"span\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;sr-only&#x22;}]\">Try Luma in shadcn/create</mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx>\n<p>Luma is a new foundation for your next app. It gives components softer surfaces, more open spacing, and a calmer visual rhythm while keeping the same shadcn/ui workflow.</p>\n<p>Like the other new styles, Luma goes beyond theming. It changes the geometry, spacing, and feel of the components so your app starts from a different visual baseline.</p>\n<p>Available now in <a href=\"/create\">shadcn/create</a> for both Radix and Base UI.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"Button\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;asChild&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;size&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;sm&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"Link\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;href&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/create?preset=b2D0wqNxT&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 no-underline!&#x22;}]\"><p>Try Luma</p></mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx>"
